      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Over several months I researched having solar power installed with varying degrees of success. The majority of companies only did a quote over the internet or phone, some that did come to the house didnt make it past the lounge room. There was only two that I felt really confident dealing with, this was because they took the time to physically inspect the roof space, the physical structures around my property that may affect the efficiency and my meter box and offered thorough advice on any  problems I may be likely to encounter and improvements I could make to ensure the best efficiency of the system. I found Neco was easy to get in contact with they were thorough with the information given on the process, different products available and quality and price differences , the installation was done with a minimum of fuss on time on without damage to any of my property. All mess was cleaned up once they had finished,electrical  inspections were booked and instuctions given of the next steps and process regarding meter upgrades ect were given before they left.",
